  restoring atom style atomic from restart
  triclinic box = (0.16909304 0.17382750 0.17479354) to (35.800907 35.796172 35.795206) with tilt (0.0000000 0.0000000 0.0000000)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
